ElyHanley.H and the baseline equations replayed by conductivity_math.py were
adapted from equations and implementation in Cantera v3.2.0,
commit 4a8358eb80cfeb50474386b5f9ec0b3a83519889,
src/transport/HighPressureGasTransport.cpp. The reference-density mapping was
corrected to use methane molecular weight per corresponding molar volume,
consistent with NBS Technical Note 1039, TCOND, printed page 58.
https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/Legacy/TN/nbstechnicalnote1039.pdf

Equation reference: Ely and Hanley (1983), Ind. Eng. Chem. Fundam. 22, 90-97,
doi:10.1021/i100009a016. This implements the explicit shape-factor variant;
the original 1981 TRAPP iterative conformal mapping/CORT correction and Liang's
unspecified rich-H2 modification are not claimed reproduced.

